## Q2. Which product categories receive the highest and lowest ratings?

### SQL Query

```sql
SELECT
    p.product_category_name AS category,
    ROUND(AVG(r.review_score), 2) AS avg_rating,
    COUNT(*) AS review_count
FROM raw_order_reviews r
JOIN raw_orders o
    ON r.order_id = o.order_id
JOIN raw_order_items oi
    ON o.order_id = oi.order_id
JOIN raw_products p
    ON oi.product_id = p.product_id
WHERE p.product_category_name IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY p.product_category_name
HAVING COUNT(*) >= 100
ORDER BY avg_rating DESC;
```

### Key Finding

Average ratings vary considerably across product categories.

**Highest-rated categories:**

| Category               | Avg Rating | Reviews |
| ---------------------- | ---------: | ------: |
| livros_interesse_geral |       4.45 |     549 |
| livros_tecnicos        |       4.37 |     266 |
| malas_acessorios       |       4.32 |   1,088 |
| alimentos_bebidas      |       4.32 |     279 |

**Lowest-rated categories:**

| Category                | Avg Rating | Reviews |
| ----------------------- | ---------: | ------: |
| moveis_escritorio       |       3.49 |   1,687 |
| fashion_roupa_masculina |       3.64 |     131 |
| telefonia_fixa          |       3.68 |     262 |
| audio                   |       3.83 |     361 |

The most notable concern is **moveis_escritorio**, which has the lowest average rating among the categories shown while also having a substantial **1,687 reviews**, making the finding more meaningful than a low rating based on only a small number of reviews.

